<!--
  The draft lease for 1002.1 (Brightwell Bakeries Ltd, Unit 4, Weir Lane Trading Estate), as the firm's
  reviewers left it: tracked changes by Priya Nair (client's points) and Helen Ashcombe (partner), and two
  comments. HTML can't express either, which is why this is flat ODF.

  Changes and comments are dated 15-17 September 2026, before the document is filed (day -41).
-->
